# SLURM logs, and job scripts. EVERY sbatch file is generated by
# scripts/slurm/generate.py -- the ablation grid and the one-off experiments
# alike -- so nothing here is lost on a fresh clone. Adding a hand-written job to
# this directory would break that promise; declare it in generate.py instead.
# results/runs/ and results/summary.md are the study's output and stay tracked.
